  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  name: nng\n  version: \"1.12.4\"\n\npackage:\n  name: ${{ name|lower }}\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/nanomsg/nng/archive/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 93b177727ec5ea38af5c88ab297f732ef71ddc4700d2407c4f9c999b3a7310a0\n  patches:\n    - if: linux\n      then: test.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 1\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib(\"c\") }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - cmake\n    - make\n    - ninja\n  host:\n    - mbedtls >=3.5,<4\n  run:\n    - if: win\n      then: ucrt\n    - ${{ pin_compatible('mbedtls', upper_bound='x.x') }}\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - if: linux\n        then: test -f $PREFIX/lib/libnng.so\n      - if: osx\n        then: test -f $PREFIX/lib/libnng.dylib\n      - if: unix\n        then: nngcat -V\n      - if: win\n        then: nngcat.exe -V\n\nabout:\n  summary: nanomsg-next-generation -- light-weight brokerless messaging\n  description: |\n    nanomsg-next-generation -- light-weight brokerless messaging\n  license: MIT\n  license_file: LICENSE.txt\n  homepage: https://nng.nanomsg.org/\n  repository: https://github.com/nanomsg/nng\n  documentation: https://nng.nanomsg.org/man/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - jan-janssen\n    - carlodri\n",
